<title>USA: Unisys Corp names Robert Brust CFO.</title>
<headline>Unisys Corp names Robert Brust CFO.</headline>
<dateline>BLUE BELL, Pa. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unisys Corp said Wednesday that Robert Brust will join the company as senior vice president and chief financial officer, effective February 24.</p>
<p>Brust, 53, joins Unisys from General Electric Co, where he had been vice president of finance for G.E. Plastics since 1988, Unisys said.</p>
<p>Unisys said Brust joined GE in 1965 and moved through a series of financial positions in various GE operations.</p>
<p>As Unisys CFO, Brust replaces Ed Blechschmidt, who left the company in July for another job.</p>
